OL,3,GNEWSAWidow with Parkinson's 'broken'
OL,4,Aover new build
OL,5,
OL,6,FA widow with Parkinson's disease said
OL,7,Fshe had been left feeling "broken" over
OL,8,Fissues with her new build house.
OL,10,FGillian Chambers, 75, moved to her
OL,11,Fproperty on Brooks Close in Lyneham,
OL,12,FWiltshire, in 2025 after the death of
OL,13,Fher husband, John, the previous year.
OL,15,FShe said there was a persistent cold
OL,16,Fdraught running through her home and
OL,17,Fshe often struggled to keep warm.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
