OL,3,GNEWSAWidow with Parkinson's 'broken'
OL,4,Aover new build
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe house was built by Linden Homes
OL,7,Fwhich is operated by Vistry. A
OL,8,Fspokesperson for the house-building
OL,9,Fgroup said it was "committed to
OL,10,Fsupporting the resident and addressing
OL,11,Fany concerns through our customer care
OL,12,Fprocess".
